{"title": "叔本华年谱", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "叔本华年谱"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1788年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "2月22日诞生于波兰的格但斯克。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1793年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "普鲁士军队占领格但斯克（改称为但泽），叔本华一家举家迁往汉堡。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1797年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华的父母旅行途经巴黎，让叔本华寄居于友人古列佛埃尔家中。其妹阿德莱诞生。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1799年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "返回，接受正规学校教育，奠定法语语言文学的基础。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1802年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "确立研究哲学的志向。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1803年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "与其父约定，放弃学术研习，参加他父母的长期的长途旅行。此次旅行，从当年春天开始，历时近两年，足迹遍历比、法、瑞士、英等国。旅行期间曾滞留英国教会学校三个月。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1804年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "秋天，旅行结束，回到但泽，接受基督教的坚信礼。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1805年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "春季，投身商界。父亲过世。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1806年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "母亲迁居魏玛。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1807年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "经母亲同意，放弃商业生涯。7月赴科塔，延聘费尔士指导一般功课，并聘请私人教师补习希腊文、拉丁文，兼习德语，研究文学。秋季，因写诗嘲笑某教授，被迫离开科塔，回到魏玛。此后，专心埋首书本，研究希腊拉丁数学、历史等，历时两年。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1809年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "9月进格丁根大学医学院。第一年学习医学、历史、物理、植物学，第二年转入哲学院专研柏拉图、康德及亚里士多德、斯宾诺莎，并旁听天文学、生理学、法学等。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1811年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "夏末转至柏林大学，除哲学外，还研究自然科学。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1813年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "完成博士论文《论充足理由律的四种根源》，荣获耶拿大学哲学博士学位。11月，回魏玛与歌德订交，受歌德宠信，邀为座上客，并受重托研究色彩学的理论。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1814年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "夏季，离开魏玛。赴德累斯顿，结识浪漫诗人梯克。确立哲学系统。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1816年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "出版《论视觉与颜色》。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1818年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "春季，出版《作为意志和表象的世界》。9月赴意大利旅行，目的是搜集哲学资料，共花费时间两年。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1819年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "主要著作寄赠歌德。歌德致信其妹，大赞叔本华的天才和文章的风格。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1820年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "3月赴柏林任教。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1821年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "8月，与女房客发生诉讼案。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1822年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "5月离开柏林，重游意大利。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1823年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "因病，右耳失聪。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1824年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "回德累斯顿。准备翻译休谟作品，未果，只写了一篇序言。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1825年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "重回柏林，为诉讼案奔走。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1826年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "5月，法院判定叔本华须供养女房客一生。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1826年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "7月，重回柏林大学讲课，再度失败。闭门读书，翻译西班牙作家格瑞显的著作。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1831年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "霍乱袭击柏林，叔本华逃离柏林。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1832年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "定居法兰克福。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1836年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "用科学的研究结果推证他的核心理论，写成《论处于自然界中的意志》一书。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1839年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "参加挪威皇家学会征文比赛入选，题目为：《意志自由与哲学中的必然性理论》。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1840年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "报名丹麦皇家学会《道德责任的根据》论文比赛，落选。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1841年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "收集两篇比赛论文，出版《伦理学的两个基本问题》。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1843年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "增补“主著”，完成《作为意志和表象的世界》全部哲学系统，致信书局老板出版，初被拒，再以“性爱的形而上学”的名义，卒获允。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1844年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "《作为意志和表象的世界》增订版发行。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1846年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "与佛劳因斯特订交，彼此或面谈或通信，交往频仍。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1850年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "完成《论文集》，致信佛劳因斯特，要求设法找寻出版商。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1851年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "出版《论文集》。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1854年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "瓦格纳题献给叔本华一部歌剧《尼伯龙根的指环》，并称赞他的音乐哲学。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1855年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "声誉大著，在法兰克福举办“叔本华油画像展览会”。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1856年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "身体仍健壮，但左耳听力渐差。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "1860年"}, {"type": "text", "value": "9月21日猝然逝世。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_042b54ee51.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "人生的智慧"}, {"type": "text", "value": "（德）叔本华◎著"}, {"type": "text", "value": "张尚德◎译"}, {"type": "text", "value": "哈尔滨出版社"}, {"type": "text", "value": "黑版贸审字08-2014-085"}, {"type": "text", "value": "图书在版编目（CIP）数据"}, {"type": "text", "value": "人生的智慧／（德）叔本华著；张尚德译．—哈尔滨：哈尔滨出版社，2015.4"}, {"type": "text", "value": "（经典天天读．哲学经典）"}, {"type": "text", "value": "ISBN 978-7-5484-2043-9"}, {"type": "text", "value": "Ⅰ．①人…　Ⅱ．①叔…②张…　Ⅲ．①叔本华，A．（1788～1860）—人生哲学—哲学思想　Ⅳ．①B516.41"}, {"type": "text", "value": "中国版本图书馆CIP数据核字（2014）第254599号"}, {"type": "text", "value": "书　　名： 人生的智慧"}, {"type": "text", "value": "作　　者： ［德］叔本华　著　［台］张尚德　译"}, {"type": "text", "value": "责任编辑： 陈春林　韩金华"}, {"type": "text", "value": "责任审校： 李　战"}, {"type": "text", "value": "装帧设计： 回归线视觉传达"}, {"type": "text", "value": "出版发行： 哈尔滨出版社（Harbin Publishing House）"}, {"type": "text", "value": "社　　址： 哈尔滨市松北区世坤路738号9号楼"}, {"type": "text", "value": "邮　　编： 150028"}, {"type": "text", "value": "经　　销： 全国新华书店"}, {"type": "text", "value": "印　　刷： 北京市文林印务有限公司"}, {"type": "text", "value": "网　　址： www.hrbcbs.com　www.mifengniao.com"}, {"type": "text", "value": "E-mail： hrbcbs@yeah.net"}, {"type": "text", "value": "编辑版权热线： （0451）87900271　87900272"}, {"type": "text", "value": "邮购热线： 4006900345（0451）87900345"}, {"type": "text", "value": "销售热线： （0451）87900201　87900202　87900203"}, {"type": "text", "value": "开　　本： 680mm×960mm　1/16"}, {"type": "text", "value": "印　　张： 13.75"}, {"type": "text", "value": "字　　数： 120千字"}, {"type": "text", "value": "版　　次： 2015年4月第1版"}, {"type": "text", "value": "印　　次： 2015年4月第1次印刷"}, {"type": "text", "value": "书　　号： ISBN 978-7-5484-2043-9"}, {"type": "text", "value": "凡购本社图书发现印装错误，请与本社印制部联系调换。"}, {"type": "text", "value": "服务热线： （0451）87900278"}, {"type": "text", "value": "本社法律顾问： 黑龙江佳鹏律师事务所"}, {"type": "text", "value": "目录"}, {"type": "text", "value": "序"}, {"type": "text", "value": "第一章　生命的划分"}, {"type": "text", "value": "第二章　什么是人格"}, {"type": "text", "value": "第三章　人能拥有什么"}, {"type": "text", "value": "第四章　地位"}, {"type": "text", "value": "一　名誉"}, {"type": "text", "value": "二　骄傲"}, {"type": "text", "value": "三　官位"}, {"type": "text", "value": "四　荣誉"}, {"type": "text", "value": "五　名声"}, {"type": "text", "value": "第五章　世界的痛苦"}, {"type": "text", "value": "一"}, {"type": "text", "value": "二"}, {"type": "text", "value": "三"}, {"type": "text", "value": "四"}, {"type": "text", "value": "五"}, {"type": "text", "value": "六"}, {"type": "text", "value": "七"}, {"type": "text", "value": "八"}, {"type": "text", "value": "九"}, {"type": "text", "value": "十"}, {"type": "text", "value": "第六章　人性"}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华年谱"}, {"type": "text", "value": "返回总目录"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_d2a1b75262.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华（1788～1860），德国哲学家，首倡唯意志论"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_d53408cfd8.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华与他的对手黑格尔（1770～1831）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_e1eac38061.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "完成《作为意志和表象的世界》第一部时的叔本华（三十岁）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_30af3dac0b.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "沉思中的叔本华"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_5545065341.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华的偶像伊曼努尔·康德（1724～1804）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_466420a602.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "《叔本华著作全集》德文版的扉页"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_44e550ece5.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华安眠之地：法兰克福北郊的中央公墓"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_fbd5547c26.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "德国悲观主义哲学家叔本华"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_1551ec93be.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "德国唯意志论代表人物叔本华"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_ff6d52f440.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华藏书票"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_fb39ad5e60.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华的母亲约翰娜·叔本华（左）和他的妹妹（右）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_0a1da840cc.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "法兰克福的叔本华故居"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_0c32e765ff.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华纪念室一角"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_a5f8dc6bd7.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "《作为意志和表象的世界》原稿之一"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_3692167471.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华胸像"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_29b666da71.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华自画像"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_518bbaeb9e.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "法兰克福的叔本华纪念碑"}, {"type": "image", "src": "/api/books/d0c5ade4fcbd/image/d0c5ade4fcbd_d3c9b6a24d.webp", "alt": ""}, {"type": "text", "value": "叔本华纪念碑台座的狮身人面像斯芬克司"}], "index": 30}